.venv

# The original game, never committed (removed from all history 2026-10-20): each test
# setup's uae/dh0/data (the data, SWOS2, the disk images WHDLoad reads, memory dumps)
# and WHDLoad's own tools and dumps. Put your own copy there to run them.
Amiga/**/uae/dh0/data/
Amiga/**/uae/dh0/data.uaem
Amiga/**/uae/dh0/c/DIC*
Amiga/**/uae/dh0/c/Patcher*
Amiga/**/uae/dh0/c/RawDIC*
Amiga/**/uae/dh0/c/WHDLoad
Amiga/**/uae/dh0/c/WHDLoad.uaem
Amiga/**/uae/dh0/c/WHDLoadCD32*
Amiga/**/uae/dh0/c/.whdl_*

# The game program and other people's tools, never committed (removed from all history
# 2026-10-20): the raw SWOS2 images IDA reads, the builds assembled from the disassembly,
# and the tool archives. Put your own copies there.
SWOS2/SWOS2
SWOS2/SWOS2.bytes
bin/*/SWOS2
build/*.o
Amiga/Tools/RNC ProPackED.rar
Amiga/Tools/SwoEditorSv1.3.7z
Amiga/Tools/uaeunp-0.8.zip
